.DS_Store

# The compiled live analyzer demo — about 3 MB of Flutter, rebuilt by
# `npm run analyzer` and by `npm run deploy`. The still in front of it
# (public/analyzer-still.webp) *is* committed, because every build needs it.
public/analyzer/

# The renderer's recording: the full take, with the per-band stereo position
# nothing on the demo's canvas draws, and the excerpt as a WAV. Ten-odd MB,
# written by `npm run record`, and it never leaves this machine — the module
# thumbnails it produces are what is committed.
#
# The *demo's* two files are committed rather than ignored, because CI deploys
# the site and cannot make them: `npm run record` needs the 35 MB source track,
# which no job here may fetch — see tool/AGENTS.md. They are 1.2 MB, they are
# already published at open-audio-analyzer.com/analyzer/, and CC BY 3.0 asks for
# credit rather than for silence — see tools/analyzer-demo/web/ATTRIBUTION.md.
tools/module-renderer/web/programme.*
